  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Area- Focused Network Plus Call - Building Inclusive Civil Societies with, and for, Young People in 5 Post-Conflict Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting social reconciliation/human rights in aftermath and the relationship between young people, building strong institutions and social justice. Benefits young people in Cambodia, Colombia, Kosovo, Rwanda and S.Africa. SDGs 16,17,4</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
